Pin that retirement stops at the last confirmation

A mutant retiring one span past the last confirmation (declared[:confirmed + 1])
passed every vector: the reload case's first new span only gets PCM after
navigating has already cleared it. The new case is a missed reload whose new
document declares and sends PCM before its generation is reported; that span
is live and must stay armed (close at 47000). test_stale_watchdog asserts the
off-by-one mutant fails it.

